Gershwin system components
==========================

url    = https://github.com/gershwin-desktop/gershwin-system.git
tag    = 26.09
commit = bb8186cdb8ab5dcafc469228e6eb60b3c8f43a97
date   = 2026-09-17

Only Library/Preferences (GlobalDefaults, fonts.conf,
GlobalShortcuts.plist) and Library/Scripts/Gershwin.sh are installed, in
/System/Library, by
tools/desktop/install-gershwin-system.sh, which foxyn-desktop(8) runs on
the desktop image; it downloads this revision's archive and checks its
SHA-256 (docs/desktop-eau.md). The other scripts and the services are not used.
When upgrading, update the revision and checksum in that script too.
License: BSD 2-Clause text in LICENSE; individual source and asset terms require review. Complete provenance review and preserve applicable notices
and source obligations before distributing selected components.
On upgrade, review dependencies, ABI, installation paths and desktop tests.
